* SPICE Netlist

V1 7 0 DC 0 ; Input voltage source

RS 7 5 50 ; Rs = 50 Ohms
C1 5 3 C1 ; C1 = coupling capacitor
RE 3 2 1k ; RE = 1k Ohm
RB 2 0 100k ; RB = 100k Ohm
CB 3 0 CB ; CB = bypass capacitor

I1 8 2 DC 0.5mA ; ICC = 0.5mA
V2 8 0 DC 5 ; V+ = +5V

C2 2 6 C2 ; C2 = coupling capacitor
RL 6 0 1k ; RL = 1k Ohm